 "notes": "Puck is unarmed: every hand is a locked-wrist punching fist (anim3d `fists`). Authored in v3/tools/puck/gen_puck.py, one move at a time, each reviewed by Daniel from GIF stills (v3/tools/puck/review/go.sh). Daniel's corrections (2026-11-24/25): wrists placed with intention, never flopping; never hit with the fingers - the first two knuckles lead, forearm pointing through them at the target; bend the back - a committed punch folds the body over and the fist follows through past the target; the line of action is ONE smooth curve from the back foot through the hips and back out along the arm (no hunched kink, head on the curve); watch the punch's line (attack_normal is an OVERHAND: over the top, going down); frame 1 of attack_normal is a WIND-UP (right arm folded behind a shoulder pulled back and down, left arm leads); no extra hits he did not describe ('hook follow up' = the follow-through). attack_normal approved ('good enough') 2026-11-25. Ultimate = Gogeta's Big Bang Kamehameha in the air: both arms cocked back, then a one-handed palm thrust with a knee tucked; reference: arm flung far back, body arched, other hand at the face, front knee up, back leg long and straight. attack_normal_3 = shoryuken: keep the coiled crouch as a moving hold. Moves travel (root motion); kamehamehas stay in place."
